/* wubu_selfbuild.hd -- a holyd-language program: THE stage-0 self-build seed.
 *
 * The compiler reads THIS file as its own language, emits a PE, drops it into
 * /n, and the module registry loads+runs it. This version actually COMPUTES:
 * f() loops i=1..10 accumulating g -> entry returns 55. It exercises the for
 * loop body + a global store through the emitter, not just a constant+return.
 */
int g = 0;
int f() { for (int i = 1; i <= 10; i++) g += i; return g; }
